@startuml
title CON-SD-D09 Fiscal Issuance Failure / Pending Exit Exception Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Central PMS payment finality recorded;
:Central PMS requests fiscal issuance from Site POS Server;
if (Fiscal issuance succeeds?) then (yes)
  :Central PMS records fiscal reference;
  :Central PMS evaluates ExitAuthorization;
else (failed / timeout / pending / unknown)
  :Payment finality is not automatically reversed;
  :Normal ExitAuthorization remains blocked;
  :Customer/operator message shows fiscal or exit pending;
  :Route to fiscal exception review;
  if (Approved manual release policy applies?) then (yes)
    :Governed manual release handoff;
  else (no)
    :Remain pending / retry / review per later design;
  endif
endif
stop

note right
Fiscal failure does not authorize exit automatically.
end note
@enduml
